=== RefStructs Sample ===
--- Mist Declared Ref Struct ---
pair.first=3
pair.second=7
pair.Sum()=10
pair.Max=7
--- Nested Ref Struct ---
nested.pair.first=10
nested.pair.second=20
nested.extra=5
nested.Total()=35
--- Ref Struct Parameters ---
AddPair=300
doubled.first=200
doubled.second=400
--- Span from Array ---
span.Length=5
span[0]=10
span[4]=50
--- ReadOnlySpan from String ---
chars.Length=12
chars[0]=H
chars[6]= 
--- Span Indexer Write ---
writeSpan[0]=99
numbers[0]=99
--- Span Slice ---
sliced.Length=3
sliced[0]=20
sliced[2]=40
--- Span Foreach ---
val=100
val=200
val=300
=== RefStructs Done ===
